<title>FRANCE: CEP Communications suspended. [Corrected 15:00 gmt]</title>
<headline>CEP Communications suspended. [Corrected 15:00 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in CEP Communications were suspended pending a statement, the SBF French Bourses' Association said.</p>
<p>CEP was suspended at 400 francs, up 15 francs.</p>
<p>(Corrects share price from 300 francs).</p>
<p>Havas has a 73 percent stake in CEP.  </p>
<p>At CEP there was no immediate comment.</p>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom in October 1995 sold its stake in media group CEP and Generale Occidentale to Havas and CEP absorbed Groupe de la Cite.</p>
<p>Havas was 3.62 percent higher at 386 francs at 1303 GMT.</p>
</text>
